            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 3,
        "original": "「かんぱーい！」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Cheers！」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 4,
        "original": "未羽",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Miu",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 5,
        "original": "「か、かんぱい、ですっ……」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Ch-cheers...」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 6,
        "original": "俺たちは約束通り再び月見団子に集まり、ジュースで杯を交わしていた。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Sesuai janji, kami berkumpul kembali di Tsukimi Dango dan bersulang dengan jus.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 7,
        "original": "昨日バイトしていた店で、というのはちょっと落ち着かない気もしたけど……。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Rasanya agak aneh berada di toko tempat kami bekerja paruh waktu kemarin, tapi...",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 8,
        "original": "どうやら休んでいたスタッフも復帰したようで、俺たちのお疲れ会は、快く受け入れてもらえた。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Tampaknya staf yang sebelumnya libur sudah kembali bekerja, dan acara perayaan kami pun disambut dengan hangat.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 9,
        "original": "それどころか……。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Bahkan lebih dari itu...",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 10,
        "original": "梓",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Azusa",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 11,
        "original": "「@t23@d1みなさん、いらっしゃいませ。昨日一昨日は本当にありがとうございました」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「@t23@d1Selamat datang, semuanya. Terima kasih banyak atas bantuan kalian kemarin dan lusa」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 12,
        "original": "梓",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Azusa",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 13,
        "original": "「これは、店長からのサービスです。召し上がってくださいね」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Ini servis dari manajer. Silakan dinikmati, ya」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 14,
        "original": "と歓迎されて、ひとりずつ水鏡餅がサービスでついてきたくらいだ。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Kami disambut dengan sangat baik, bahkan masing-masing dari kami mendapatkan Mikagamimochi secara gratis.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 15,
        "original": "笑顔で感謝してもらえるくらい、大変なときを手伝えたということで……。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Melihat mereka berterima kasih dengan senyuman, rasanya sangat berarti bisa membantu di saat-saat sulit...",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 16,
        "original": "梓",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Azusa",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 17,
        "original": "「それでは、ごゆっくり」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Kalau begitu, silakan dinikmati waktunya」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 18,
        "original": "ひより",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Hiyori",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 19,
        "original": "「ありがたくいただきます！いやぁ、よかったよかった」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Terima kasih banyak！ Wah, syukurlah kalau semuanya lancar」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 20,
        "original": "と、俺たちの口元も自然とほころびる。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Melihat itu, kami pun tak bisa menahan senyum.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 21,
        "original": "未羽",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Miu",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 22,
        "original": "「ほんとだね。私はＳＳＲの活動に参加したのは初めてだけど……『みんなを笑顔にする』って、とっても素敵な理念だね」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Benar juga, ya. Ini pertama kalinya aku ikut kegiatan SSR, tapi... 'Membuat semua orang tersenyum' adalah prinsip yang sangat indah」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 23,
        "original": "ひより",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Hiyori",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 24,
        "original": "「ふふふ、そうだろうそうだろう。未羽もどうやら分かってきたようだね」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Fufufu, benar, kan? Sepertinya Miu mulai paham sekarang」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 25,
        "original": "一登",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Ichito",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 26,
        "original": "「みんなを笑顔にすることで、俺たちも笑顔になれるってのがまたいいよな」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Bagus juga ya, dengan membuat orang lain tersenyum, kita sendiri pun ikut merasa senang」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 27,
        "original": "未羽",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Miu",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 28,
        "original": "「はい……。ちょうど今みたいに、ですよね」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Iya... Sama seperti sekarang ini, kan?」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 29,
        "original": "改めて、笑い合う。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Sekali lagi, kami tertawa bersama.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 30,
        "original": "一発目の依頼としては、最高の形で終われたんじゃないだろうか。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Sebagai permintaan pertama, kurasa ini berakhir dengan cara yang paling sempurna.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 31,
        "original": "当然、有里栖をはじめとした他のメンバーにも連絡済みで、みんな喜んでくれてたし……。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Tentu saja, aku sudah mengabari anggota lain termasuk Arisu, dan mereka semua merasa senang...」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 32,
        "original": "無事依頼完遂と書き込んでおいたので、おそらくは今後にもつながるはずだ。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Aku sudah menuliskan bahwa permintaannya selesai dengan lancar, jadi seharusnya ini bisa membuka jalan untuk ke depannya.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 33,
        "original": "ひより",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Hiyori",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 34,
        "original": "「そういうことならだね、未羽」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Kalau begitu, Miu」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 35,
        "original": "と、白河がイタズラっぽい笑みと共に切り出してきた。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Ucap Shirakawa sambil menyunggingkan senyum jahil.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "original": "未羽",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Miu",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
        "original": "「なあに？ひよりちゃん」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Ada apa, Hiyori-chan？」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
